{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"罗马书","commonName":"罗马书","title":"罗马书","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"9bcc884b0e342bd59c26ecf953bcd0a7ce0be56a44a95eee01272b5e756d0dd5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":433},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["顺服掌权者"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["在上有权柄的，人人当顺服他，因为没有权柄不是出于 神的。凡掌权的都是 神所命的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["所以，抗拒掌权的就是抗拒 神的命；抗拒的必自取刑罚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["作官的原不是叫行善的惧怕，乃是叫作恶的惧怕。你愿意不惧怕掌权的吗？你只要行善，就可得他的称赞；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因为他是 神的用人，是与你有益的。你若作恶，却当惧怕，因为他不是空空地佩剑；他是 神的用人，是伸冤的，刑罚那作恶的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["所以，你们必须顺服，不但是因为刑罚，也是因为良心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你们纳粮，也为这个缘故；因他们是 神的差役，常常特管这事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["凡人所当得的，就给他。当得粮的，给他纳粮；当得税的，给他上税；当惧怕的，惧怕他；当恭敬的，恭敬他。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["相爱如兄弟"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["凡事都不可亏欠人，惟有彼此相爱要常以为亏欠，因为爱人的就完全了律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["像那不可奸淫，不可杀人，不可偷盗，不可贪婪，或有别的诫命，都包在爱人如己这一句话之内了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["爱是不加害与人的，所以爱就完全了律法。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["白昼将近"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["再者，你们晓得，现今就是该趁早睡醒的时候；因为我们得救，现今比初信的时候更近了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["黑夜已深，白昼将近。我们就当脱去暗昧的行为，带上光明的兵器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["行事为人要端正，好像行在白昼。不可荒宴醉酒；不可好色邪荡；不可争竞嫉妒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["总要披戴主耶稣基督，不要为肉体安排，去放纵私欲。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}